1
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,770
<i>Right now</i>

2
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,890
<i>Never lose!
I won't</i>

3
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,270
<i>"Just a bit more" I said</i>

4
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:25,190
<i>Swinging my hopes and fists</i>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:27,820
<i>It's not someone else's power</i>

6
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:30,570
<i>Believe in your self</i>

7
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:47,590
<i>The clash between strength and strength</i>

8
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:51,680
<i>Has always crossed oceans and skies</i>

9
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,890
<i>Far into space</i>

10
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,520
<i>Rise to the front lines until the end</i>

11
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:58,890
<i>With the ultimate hit</i>

12
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:02,060
<i>Always in full attack</i>

13
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:07,360
<i>I won't lose- I'll win!</i>

14
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:09,740
<i>Alright nanana</i>

15
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:13,410
<i>Alright, let's get started
on the final push!</i>

16
00:01:13,570 --> 00:01:15,780
<i>Mighty warrior, audacious</i>

17
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:19,330
<i>I believe in my power</i>

18
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,210
<i>Right now</i>

19
00:01:21,370 --> 00:01:23,210
<i>Never lose!
I won't</i>

20
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:25,710
<i>"Just a bit more" I said</i>

21
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:29,800
<i>Swinging my hopes and fists</i>

22
00:01:29,970 --> 00:01:32,180
<i>All my efforts up until now</i>

23
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,640
<i>And my frustrations fueled me</i>

24
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,970
<i>It's not someone else's power</i>

25
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:40,100
<i>Believe in your self</i>

26
00:02:16,970 --> 00:02:19,680
THE GOD WHO DESTROYS

27
00:02:38,910 --> 00:02:40,830
Father!

28
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:43,000
Brought you lunch.

29
00:02:43,910 --> 00:02:47,290
Oh, Goten!
Is school out already?

30
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:49,460
Today is Sunday.

31
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:51,250
So you're off?!

32
00:02:52,670 --> 00:02:55,300
Take my place behind the wheel, then.

33
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:56,720
Sure...

34
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,390
Let's dig in.

35
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:11,150
This was delicious!
I'm done!

36
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,320
Okay!

37
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:52,480
Goten, I can't focus on my training
if you don't behave properly.

38
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,310
Father, were you training?

39
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:59,110
Yeah.
Majin Buu was terribly strong, right?

40
00:05:59,730 --> 00:06:02,530
<i>I couldn't defeat him on my own.</i>

41
00:06:03,110 --> 00:06:05,780
Another one like him might come along.

42
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:08,910
I gotta train to be prepared.

43
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:10,160
Hmm...

44
00:06:11,910 --> 00:06:13,120
To tell you the truth...

45
00:06:13,290 --> 00:06:16,170
I wanna go train at Kai-sama's,

46
00:06:16,330 --> 00:06:18,000
<i>but Chichi...</i>

47
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:21,300
<i>Mother must be
the strongest person in the world.</i>

48
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:26,890
Grandpa Gyumao doesn't have much money,
since he lost his treasures in a fire.

49
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:32,230
But Mother said you could make more money
at some other job.

50
00:06:32,930 --> 00:06:34,230
<i>Like Mr. Satan.</i>

51
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:42,860
I prefer slackin' off
and trainin' instead.

52
00:07:33,330 --> 00:07:35,460
Hey there, Goku-san!

53
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:38,380
Chichi-san told me I could find you here.

54
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:39,920
Mr. Satan!

55
00:07:40,090 --> 00:07:44,460
Thanks for buildin'
such a big house for Gohan.

56
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:49,180
Don't mention it.
Videl is my daughter after all.

57
00:07:49,550 --> 00:07:53,850
By the way,
did you see the afternoon news?

58
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,930
Nope. What's goin' on?

59
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:59,350
Really? Actually...

60
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:04,320
I was given the World Peace Award...

61
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,650
The World...?

62
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:10,120
Because, you know,
I kept saving the world...

63
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:15,250
So I received a special reward.
100 million Zeni.

64
00:08:15,410 --> 00:08:18,870
<i>But this money is rightfully yours.</i>

65
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,580
I didn't fight alone.

66
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:24,960
<i>You fought as hard as you could, too.</i>

67
00:08:25,130 --> 00:08:27,300
But I'm rich already.

68
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:30,180
Vegeta-san turned me down as well.

69
00:08:30,550 --> 00:08:33,510
Well, he's part of the richest family
in the world.

70
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:38,440
Tell me, how many 100,000 Zeni
are there in 100 million?

71
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:43,860
What? 100,000 Zeni?
Let's see... A thousand.

72
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:47,150
A thousand?!
One thousand 100,000 Zeni?

73
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:50,990
I don't need it.
That's way too much money.

74
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,490
You should take it.

75
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:59,460
If you do, I'm sure Mother will let you
go train at Kai-sama's.

76
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:00,920
You think so?

77
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,090
But...

78
00:09:09,550 --> 00:09:11,050
Okay, got it!

79
00:09:11,590 --> 00:09:14,300
Then I'll accept it!
But are you sure?

80
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:16,680
In that case...

81
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,480
Thank you!

82
00:09:19,140 --> 00:09:20,190
Great!

83
00:09:21,020 --> 00:09:24,440
And, sorry to bring this up,

84
00:09:24,610 --> 00:09:27,610
but in exchange
you must keep this a secret.

85
00:09:28,990 --> 00:09:31,570
100 million Zeni?!

86
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:33,780
This is great!

87
00:09:33,950 --> 00:09:36,580
With this much money,
we can send Goten to cram school

88
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:39,080
and get him many private tutors!

89
00:09:39,250 --> 00:09:40,330
Well done!

90
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:46,420
In that case, Chichi,
think I can go train at Kai-sama's?

91
00:09:46,590 --> 00:09:49,420
Sure. But do come home from time to time.

92
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,220
Alrighty!

93
00:10:26,170 --> 00:10:28,800
What are you doing?!
Hurry up!

94
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:59,530
Today is a perfect day for a drive.

95
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:01,490
Nice and peaceful.

96
00:11:01,660 --> 00:11:03,830
Peace is best.

97
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:07,750
A piece of peace...

98
00:11:20,810 --> 00:11:23,100
Please help yourself.

99
00:11:23,270 --> 00:11:30,730
Each dish is a <i>trĂ¨s bien</i> masterpiece
prepared by the best chefs on this planet.

100
00:11:30,900 --> 00:11:32,690
Really?

101
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:34,940
Hmm...

102
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:41,490
You're forgetting your manners.

103
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:42,790
What's this?

104
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:49,750
A La Planeteze made from naturally
sterilized 100% organic beef!

105
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:55,170
A La Pla-pla-pla?
What a bothersome name!

106
00:12:05,730 --> 00:12:07,270
It's sort of delicious!

107
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:11,360
Not too salty, just the way I like it.

108
00:12:12,730 --> 00:12:14,650
So... about our planet...

109
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:16,530
But you know...

110
00:12:17,610 --> 00:12:20,370
it's a bit too fatty.

111
00:12:20,530 --> 00:12:24,080
Only half this time then...

112
00:12:24,450 --> 00:12:25,910
Only half?

113
00:12:35,510 --> 00:12:38,340
What is the matter, Elder Kai-sama?

114
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:42,760
Was the tea too bitter?

115
00:12:44,470 --> 00:12:45,600
This is bad.

116
00:12:46,310 --> 00:12:48,430
Really bad.

117
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:51,980
<i>After 39 years...</i>

118
00:12:53,190 --> 00:12:57,150
<i>the God of Destruction Beerus-sama
has woken up...</i>

119
00:12:58,030 --> 00:13:00,950
I thought you said it was delicious,
Beerus-sama.

120
00:13:01,110 --> 00:13:05,120
Too much fat isn't good for your health.

121
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:07,790
Too much fat...

122
00:13:10,460 --> 00:13:14,040
Don't pop up in front of me, you idiot!

123
00:13:14,210 --> 00:13:16,170
Sorry, sorry!

124
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:21,840
But your powers can easily fix
something like a house or a car.

125
00:13:22,340 --> 00:13:24,180
You don't get it.

126
00:13:24,350 --> 00:13:29,980
Fixing things with your hands is
a way to kill ti... I mean to have fun.

127
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:33,020
Anyway, why are you here, Goku?

128
00:13:33,190 --> 00:13:34,860
I hame hu...

129
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:38,690
Don't talk with your mouth full!

130
00:13:40,450 --> 00:13:42,360
I'm full!

131
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:44,160
Why am I here?

132
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,660
To train, of course.

133
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:50,000
The gravity on your planet
is ten times that of Earth.

134
00:13:50,410 --> 00:13:53,500
There's no better place to get in shape.

135
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:59,130
Do something about those clothes!

136
00:14:09,310 --> 00:14:14,310
Training level 1... 2... 3... 4...

137
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:16,520
Start!

138
00:14:36,170 --> 00:14:37,500
<i>Kakarot...</i>

139
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:44,510
<i>The strongest Saiyan I've ever faced!</i>

140
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:47,100
<i>But listen, Kakarot...</i>

141
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:52,680
<i>I have no intention to settle
for second place forever!</i>

142
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:55,440
<i>One day I will surpass you...</i>

143
00:14:55,600 --> 00:15:00,020
No, I'll surpass everyone
in this universe...

144
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:04,570
...and become the ultimate fighter!

145
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:09,160
Hmm... What was it?

146
00:15:10,580 --> 00:15:13,120
Just as I'm about to remember...

147
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:15,500
it slips away.

148
00:15:21,380 --> 00:15:22,590
Whis!

149
00:15:23,170 --> 00:15:24,720
Are you done yet?

150
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:23,360
This dinosaur meat looks delicious.

151
00:16:26,070 --> 00:16:27,360
Well...

152
00:16:57,560 --> 00:17:00,900
Beerus-sama gave me only three minutes.

153
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:04,400
It's been only 2 minutes and 20 seconds.

154
00:17:05,150 --> 00:17:10,320
Really? I feel like I've been
kept waiting for 220 years.

155
00:17:10,490 --> 00:17:16,160
You've been fussy ever since you woke up.
What's the matter?

156
00:17:16,330 --> 00:17:21,170
It's just a rumor
that the dinosaur meat tastes delicious.

157
00:17:21,330 --> 00:17:24,460
I want to try it anyway.

158
00:17:24,630 --> 00:17:28,510
I imagine it will taste quite zesty.

159
00:17:29,760 --> 00:17:34,970
It may help me remember
the guy I saw in my dream.

160
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,180
Dream?

161
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:37,930
My prophetic dream.

162
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:42,100
Your prophetic dreams are not
very accurate, are they?

163
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:48,730
Your last one, about a celebrity moving
into the neighborhood, never happened.

164
00:17:49,190 --> 00:17:50,570
You're making fun of me.

165
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:27,190
You're boring.

166
00:18:35,450 --> 00:18:36,490
Oh, my.

167
00:18:43,660 --> 00:18:44,960
Right back at you.

168
00:18:51,670 --> 00:18:52,840
Are you done?

169
00:18:53,220 --> 00:18:56,430
I hate people who have no manners.

170
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:59,220
Now, what was I saying?

171
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:02,430
About the person you saw in a dream
and then forgot.

172
00:19:02,600 --> 00:19:06,020
Right. I'm this close to remembering.

173
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:12,530
It feels so uncomfortable.
As if something is stuck in my back teeth.

174
00:19:12,690 --> 00:19:16,990
As if earwax keeps making rustling noises
deep inside my ears.

175
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:19,200
Do you get it? Do you?!

176
00:19:19,910 --> 00:19:23,370
Beerus-sama, what shall we do
with the dinosaur meat?

177
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:28,630
I don't want it.
It doesn't look delicious anyway.

178
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:19,930
It has become rather bleak,

179
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:24,850
but it always feels good
to watch a planet exploding.

180
00:20:28,100 --> 00:20:32,110
Did you really not want the dinosaur meat?

181
00:20:36,280 --> 00:20:37,780
I don't need it.

182
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:39,910
You mean...?

183
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:47,750
Yes. This powerful explosion
helped me remember his name.

184
00:20:57,970 --> 00:21:01,510
An ultimate warrior nobody has ever seen.

185
00:21:01,680 --> 00:21:05,180
Someone incredible who will entertain me.

186
00:21:05,970 --> 00:21:08,180
His name is...

187
00:21:08,930 --> 00:21:11,020
His name is...?

188
00:21:12,650 --> 00:21:14,060
What was it?

189
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:19,570
Super... Super... Super...

190
00:21:20,780 --> 00:21:23,280
Super Saiyan God!

191
00:21:23,450 --> 00:21:26,870
Super Saiyan... God?

192
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:27,830
Huh?

193
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:31,370
Well... well...

194
00:21:31,540 --> 00:21:34,630
Maybe. Or maybe not.

195
00:21:34,790 --> 00:21:36,130
Oh, boy...

196
00:21:36,630 --> 00:21:40,470
Take your time trying to remember
over dinner at the castle.

197
00:21:40,630 --> 00:21:42,050
Good idea.

198
00:21:42,510 --> 00:21:43,470
Okay then.

199
00:22:16,090 --> 00:22:17,500
<i>The face of a winner</i>

200
00:22:17,670 --> 00:22:19,340
<i>Still hanging on, at the limit</i>

201
00:22:19,510 --> 00:22:21,380
<i>The paper dancing in the air
flashes brilliantly</i>

202
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:24,050
<i>I piled up many failures along the way</i>

203
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:25,140
<i>That's right</i>

204
00:22:25,300 --> 00:22:27,050
<i>Standing tall, on my toes</i>

205
00:22:27,220 --> 00:22:31,100
<i>The view matters more than a sprain</i>

206
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:34,810
<i>Did you think sorrow could defeat me?</i>

207
00:22:34,980 --> 00:22:39,150
<i>I eat that up, three meals a day</i>

208
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:41,240
<i>A strong wind surges again</i>

209
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,070
<i>Many troubles come my way</i>

210
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:46,030
<i>Time to focus</i>

211
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:48,160
<i>I swear
I have high hopes</i>

212
00:22:48,330 --> 00:22:51,080
<i>I'll be complete in the near future</i>

213
00:22:51,250 --> 00:22:53,080
<i>A presence growing day by day by day</i>

214
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:54,620
<i>That's the proof</i>

215
00:22:54,790 --> 00:22:58,840
<i>My life will make sparks fly</i>

216
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,460
<i>There's nothing I can't do</i>

217
00:23:01,630 --> 00:23:02,920
<i>The pinnacle of perfection</i>

218
00:23:05,180 --> 00:23:06,720
<i>The pinnacle of perfection</i>

219
00:23:07,090 --> 00:23:08,600
<i>Perfection!</i>

220
00:23:11,430 --> 00:23:12,600
NEXT EPISODE

221
00:23:12,770 --> 00:23:15,560
THE GOD OF DESTRUCTION
HEADS TO THE PLANET OF THE KAI
